---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Interval"
  description="Privacy Policy for Interval: Spacing Calculator."
>
  <div class="container section">
    <span class="section-label">// interval</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: September 7, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose privacy-prose">
      <div class="highlight-box">
        <strong>Summary:</strong> Interval does not collect, transmit, store, or share user data.
      </div>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p><strong>None.</strong> Interval does not require an account and does not collect personal information or any other user data.</p>

      <h2>How the App Works</h2>
      <p>
        Interval performs its spacing calculations on your iPhone. It has no backend and does not connect to the internet.
        The app does not retain your calculations or other user data.
      </p>

      <h2>Tracking, Analytics, and Third Parties</h2>
      <p>
        Interval does not use analytics, tracking, advertising, third-party runtime SDKs, or third-party services.
        It does not transmit or share data with anyone.
      </p>

      <h2>Device Access</h2>
      <p>Interval does not request device permissions.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>Any future changes to this policy will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:matt@mattdonders.com?subject=Interval%20Privacy">matt@mattdonders.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-subtle);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy-prose h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .privacy-prose p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .highlight-box {
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .highlight-box strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
